            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Disclosed is a method and apparatus for separately configuring sets of frequency resources for a PDCCH and another physical channel. According to the method, the first and second messages are configured separately to respectively indicate the sets of frequency resources with associated numerologies for the PDCCH and other physical channels.</p>
